Tommy UI v1.003

Tommy UI is an independent modification of the Android Open Source Project for
the Motorola Moto G Play 2024. The AOSP repositories and revisions used by the
project are identified in manifests/aosp.xml. The modified files are identified
by path in files.json and patches/. Browser2's replaced manifest originates
from the Chromium Authors (Copyright 2015); its license is reproduced in
licenses/packages/apps/Browser2/LICENSE. The procedural wallpaper and boot animation
are accompanied by their generators in art/.

The license for Tommy UI additions is in LICENSE. Notices and license texts
from the affected upstream projects are preserved under licenses/, including
the Chromium Authors' license for packages/apps/Browser2. The Android source
checkout has additional projects with their own license and notice files.
